_olex2_refinement_description    
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups
2. Restrained distances
 C00F-C00E \\sim C00F-C00C \\sim C00D-C00C \\sim C00D-C00A
 with sigma of 0.02
3. Rigid bond restraints
 C00F, C00E, N008, C00A, C00D, C00C
 with sigma for 1-2 distances of 0.01 and sigma for 1-3 distances of 0.01
4.a Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 C00D(H00D), C00E(H00E), C00F(H00F)
;
